/contact  /contact/  301

# No 404 fallback rule here — _redirects only accepts status
# 200/301/302/303/307/308 on a rule, so a "404" rule is silently dropped.
# The fallback is instead `not_found_handling = "404-page"` in wrangler.toml's
# [assets] block, which serves dist/404.html (built by
# scripts/prerender-routes.mjs) with a real 404 status for any unmatched
# request — the correct mechanism for this project's deployment model
# (Worker with static assets, not classic Cloudflare Pages).
